{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eyes on Yuki is a chaotic co-op multiplayer tower defense that will put your skills (and your patience) to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main mission?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather materials, build your defenses, and protect Yuki from his magical, absurd, cozy kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teaming up is essential to progress in the game: transport heavy materials,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">remove obstacles, create turrets... Coordination is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Better_Together.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drag your friend onto the couch, get ready for the most chaotic action, and join forces to battle the most mystical and adorable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Materials.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the different materials that you need and plan your strategy with them, well, if you can really figure out how to do it in all the chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Turrets.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build various turrets with the help of the factory using the materials you've collected. Each one will have a different attack and impact on each type of enemy. Make the most of it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Strategy.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you gather all the materials first or will you collect and build turrets at the same time? Whatever you choose, beware with the hordes of enemies, they won't give you a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Protect.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main mission? Protect Yuki and not just from enemies, let's say our little one is a bit... erm... clumsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Chaos.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you think everything it\u2019s chaotic now, just wait until you see how absurd things get as you progress through the levels. It will be hilarious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Mystical.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a mystical aesthetic and a cozy atmosphere that will transport you to the very forest where our clumsy and adorable protagonist lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/WIP.jpg?t=1747240063\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3281600?t=1747240063","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747240063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s