n really figure out how to do it in all the chaos...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Turrets.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build various turrets with the help of the factory using the materials you've collected. Each one will have a different attack and impact on each type of enemy. Make the most of it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Strategy.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you gather all the materials first or will you collect and build turrets at the same time? Whatever you choose, beware with the hordes of enemies, they won't give you a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Protect.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your main mission? Protect Yuki and not just from enemies, let's say our little one is a bit... erm... clumsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Chaos.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you think everything it\u2019s chaotic now, just wait until you see how absurd things get as you progress through the levels. It will be hilarious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/Mystical.png?t=1747240063\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a mystical aesthetic and a cozy atmosphere that will transport you to the very forest where our clumsy and adorable protagonist lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/extras/WIP.jpg?t=1747240063\" /></div></p>","developers":["Atabey Creations"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3281600/header.jpg?t=1747240063","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Eyes on Yuki","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1024 VRAM); Radeon HD 7750 (1024 VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 (2048 VRAM); Radeon R9 380 (2048 VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Atabey Creations"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"r